===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|sg=Freon&trade;}}
Freon ® is a registered trademark belonging to E.I. du Pont de Nemours & Company (DuPont). 
# {{organic compounds}} Any of several non-flammable [[refrigerant]]s based on [[halogenate]]d [[hydrocarbon]] including [[R-12]] [[R-22]] and [[R23]]. A new line of DuPont refrigerants are trademarked Suva® which includes [[R134a]]. 
